[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11281.03, "timestamp": "03:08:01", "text": "为了确保它是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11283.19, "timestamp": "03:08:03", "text": "你尽量保持不动。是的。稳定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11285.269, "timestamp": "03:08:05", "text": "你自己。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11287.349, "timestamp": "03:08:07", "text": "还要别的吗？否则，请输入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11289.91, "timestamp": "03:08:09", "text": "好的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11291.429, "timestamp": "03:08:11", "text": "我刚刚意识到我不小心踢了一脚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11292.79, "timestamp": "03:08:12", "text": "这些人被排除在主动性之外。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11294.71, "timestamp": "03:08:14", "text": "让我快速重新滚动一下。我认为是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11296.79, "timestamp": "03:08:16", "text": "四、我把它们加进去就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11300.469, "timestamp": "03:08:20", "text": "四个。呃，应该是四。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11301.99, "timestamp": "03:08:21", "text": "是的。好的。那里。轮到你了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11306.75, "timestamp": "03:08:26", "text": "你好，塔基斯。抱歉，刚才有点不方便。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11308.15, "timestamp": "03:08:28", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11312.15, "timestamp": "03:08:32", "text": "你喜欢像这样大约10英尺长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11312.63, "timestamp": "03:08:32", "text": "那个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11313.83, "timestamp": "03:08:33", "text": "你看，我觉得我们最终都会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11318.15, "timestamp": "03:08:38", "text": "宝贝，穿上那只靴子。这就是人生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11324.469, "timestamp": "03:08:44", "text": "损害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11327.269, "timestamp": "03:08:47", "text": "她要送给我们一条火龙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11329.67, "timestamp": "03:08:49", "text": "交给男人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11333.19, "timestamp": "03:08:53", "text": "搞什么鬼？把它放进脆皮里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11335.11, "timestamp": "03:08:55", "text": "实际上。是啊，说得对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11338.469, "timestamp": "03:08:58", "text": "放在脆皮上。不要碰我。"}]